    "description": "Video Downloader is the best free HD video downloader & player for all Android devices.\r\n\r\nIt can easily download videos in all formats at <b>lightning speed</b>\u26a1\ufe0f, and play <b>HD, UHD, 4K, and 1080P</b> videos smoothly without stuttering, providing you with an unparalleled audiovisual experience.\r\n\r\nVideo Downloader supports multi-thread downloads and background downloads and also supports hiding videos in password-protected folders to make your private videos only visible to you.\r\n\r\nSo why wait? Download FOR FREE now and enjoy your own mini-cinema at home!\ud83c\udfa5\r\n\r\n<u>What can Video Downloader do:</u>\r\n\r\n- Fast download all video formats: MKV, MP4, M4V, MOV, 3GP, FLV, F4V, WEBM, etc. \r\n- Play HD, UHD, 4K, and 1080P smoothly. \r\n- Download multiple videos at once.\r\n- A-B repeat & looping mode.\r\n- Auto detect and load local video files. \r\n- Securely store private videos in private folders.\r\n- Background video download & playback.\r\n- Support screen lock to prevent accidental touch when watching videos.\r\n- Smart & intuitive gesture control. \r\n- Support setting a sleep timer.\r\n\r\n<b>Video Downloader for All Formats</b>\r\nDownload videos in all formats at high definition and ultra-fast speeds. \r\n\r\n<b>Background Video Downloader & Video Player</b>\r\nVideo Downloader supports downloading and playing videos in the background. You can enjoy uninterrupted video entertainment while doing other things.\r\n\r\n<b>Hide Your Secret Videos</b>\r\nHide your private videos and movies and lock them in password-protected folders.\r\n\r\nVideo Downloader is an all-in-one video player and downloader. Try it now to experience the amazing audiovisual feast!\ud83c\udf89\r\n\r\nWe are dedicated to providing a better user experience. If you have any ideas or feedback, please do not hesitate to contact us via hvideoplayerfeedback@gmail.com.",
